            "title": "Industrial Equipment Installation & Maintenance",
            "desc": "Maintech Vietnam Co., Ltd. specializes in providing installation, maintenance, and construction services for industrial equipment, lifting systems, and factory mechanical engineering in Ho Chi Minh City and provinces nationwide. With a team of experienced engineers and professional implementation processes, Maintech is committed to providing safe, effective, and cost-optimized technical solutions for manufacturing enterprises and industrial plants.",
