        "intro": {
            "title": "Introduction",
            "content1": "Maintechvn is a unit specializing in designing, installing and maintaining port equipment, industrial lifting systems and F&B systems in Vietnam and Southeast Asia.",
            "content2": "We have participated in deploying services and providing equipment for projects in Vietnam, Cambodia, Malaysia and have cooperated with technical partners in Germany. Practical experience in multinational environments helps Maintechvn clearly understand requirements for technical standards, operational safety and construction progress according to each market.",
